  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TA WUBANA FARM PLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prinso B.V. has set up Wubana Plc in Ethiopia to set up a farm. The farm will cultivate mung beans, sesame seeds, sunflower seeds and teff both for the local market as also for export. TA will be used for: conducting soil analysis on the land to obtain data; Organic and Global GAP certification; finalizing the construction of a road to improve farm accessibility</narrative>
  </description>
